start: cursor=1000 running=False
def-armed: Define macro: enter a name
name-taken: Define step: enter commands separated by ;
defined: defined step (2 commands)
list: step: 2000 ; 3000
run-armed: Run macro: enter a name
ran: ran step (2 commands), last: 3000 = 0x0000000000000bb8 (3000)
after-run: cursor=3000 running=False
absent: no such macro: nope
nest-defined: defined loop (3 commands)
nest-ran: ran loop (3 commands), last: refused: already running a macro, will not nest into loop
after-nest: cursor=4000 running=False
repeat-armed: Repeat: enter a count and a command, as in 3 mem
repeated: repeated $ + 100 3 times, last: $ + 100 = 0x00000000000014b4 (5300)
after-repeat: cursor=5300 running=False
repeat-over: refused: count 99 is over the 64 limit
cpu-cr: control registers
cpu-cr-lines: 2
cpu-feat: cpu features
cpu-feat-lines: 4
cpuid-armed: CPUID: enter a leaf
cpuid-leaf1: leaf #00000001
leaf-cursor: 1
cpuid-refused: refused
leaf-cursor-after-refusal: 1
trace-on: port trace ON
read-armed: Port read: enter a port (0x0 to 0xffff)
trace-count: 1
trace-header: Port trace ON: 1 kept of 1, capacity 64
trace-line:   #03fd = 
trace-cleared: port trace cleared
count-after-clear: 0
disarmed-records-nothing: 0
watch-armed: Watch a port: enter a port (0x0 to 0xffff)
watched: watching port 0x000003f6, 1 watched
port-refused: port read cancelled -- 131071 is not a port
cleared: macros cleared
list-after-clear: (no macros defined)
